comments[13]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-24T15:23:02.991Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status PM read found pm-lwmstb as the shipped canonical predecessor, whose deliberate lossless/non-blocking policy is the behavior challenged by GH-1104. This is a post-fix follow-on under the same merge-safety lineage, not a duplicate."
  "2026-08-24T16:39:19.732Z","harness:codex","Evidence 2026-08-24: linked temporary-repository integration and remediation tests passed 23/23 with trusted local-source provenance. The test creates an actual git merge receipt, proves health is non-green, proves history-repair does not clear it, proves reconcile clears the lossless receipt, and proves lossy decisions retain their distinct code. Full 7,893-test suite, exact 100% coverage, generated error catalog/refusal census, static quality, lint, package and external-consumer gates all passed."
  "2026-08-24T17:57:09.370Z","harness:codex","Final evidence: pnpm quality:static passed, the corrected integration gate evidence paths are recognized, Bugbot final review reported no bugs, and Security Review reported no actionable findings. Lossless pending receipts remain classified as merge_receipts_pending with reconcile remediation; lossy decisions retain merge_decisions_unreviewed."
  "2026-08-24T17:59:25.172Z","harness:codex","Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1108 at reviewed implementation head c855a5dd656c449a0fde5c0341dde0ff128f68d5."
  "2026-08-24T18:01:22.625Z","harness:codex","Hosted review recurrence: Sourcery correctly observed that GH-1104 requires receipt-attributable history_drift remediation itself to point at pm merge reconcile. Scope: correlate pending receipt item ids with drifted item ids, prioritize reconcile only on intersection, preserve history-repair for unrelated drift, and add a mixed-state negative control."
  "2026-08-24T21:59:30.143Z","harness:codex","Final implementation evidence 2026-08-24: linked tests passed 26/26 and 58/58 with trusted local_source_ref provenance; global exact coverage passed 572 files / 7,902 tests at 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines with zero uncovered counts. Static quality direct report is clean (100% docstrings, no complexity/duplicate/orphan/SDK-boundary findings); repository assurance, package boundaries, SDK parity, surface replication, grammar/flags, 117 refusal probes, tracker context, graph composition, defect evidence, lint, zero-duplicate scan, and package artifact gates passed. The full wrapper reached only the CLI timing floor under host renderer contention; detached unchanged main reproduced the same get miss at 382ms, so the budget was preserved for hosted CI. Bugbot found no bugs and Security Review found no actionable findings on the exact final workspace. Negative controls prove malformed or divergent same-ID receipt evidence refuses before history mutation, and same-provenance partial settlement remains pending until both copies reconcile."
  "2026-08-31T06:12:14.669Z","harness:codex","Recurrence evidence: GitHub #1161 shows listMergeReceipts changed from throw to default to silent drop across supported releases. This cycle will define the malformed/incomplete contract, preserve rejected evidence through a typed SDK inspection result, keep the compatibility list wrapper explicit, and prove CLI/health consumers distinguish no receipts from unusable receipts."
  "2026-08-31T08:13:03.114Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence 2026-08-31: the public SDK now exposes inspectMergeReceiptEvidence and runMergeReceiptEvidenceReport so gates distinguish an empty store from rejected evidence without leaking malformed content; legacy list/report projections remain valid-only for compatibility. pm merge report uses the SDK contract, emits complete=false plus invalid_evidence_count, and exits 1 on incomplete evidence. A manual temporary repository with two malformed receipts returned count=0, invalid_evidence_count=2, complete=false, exit 1; packed SDK imports, CLI/runtime regressions, linked PM tests, security scans, static quality, and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage pass."
  "2026-08-31T08:24:45.659Z","harness:codex","Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1165 — the reviewed branch exposes loss-aware receipt evidence in the public SDK and delegates CLI/runtime fail-closed behavior to it."
  "2026-08-31T08:44:36.197Z","harness:codex","PR #1165 review finding validated: corrected the public complete docstring to describe validation completeness independently from includeReconciled filtering and made the CLI report mock internally consistent. Generated extension metadata finding was false: .managed-extensions.json was updated by the authoritative pm package install workflow."
  "2026-08-31T09:13:25.500Z","harness:codex","Review remediation verification: the corrected completeness contract and report fixture are included in the final exact 100/100/100/100 coverage run and the complete quality:static gate; no public boundary or docstring violations remain."
  "2026-08-31T09:52:26.642Z","harness:codex","Exact-head review finding: resolveReceiptDirectory maps git rev-parse failure to null, causing the loss-aware report to certify completeness without locating clone-local evidence. Reopened for an explicit repository-resolution receipt, fail-closed report semantics, and resolved-empty/non-repository regressions."
  "2026-08-31T10:27:30.160Z","harness:codex","Review remediation evidence: loss-aware receipt scans and reports now emit clone_local_evidence_resolved and complete only when the clone-local receipt directory resolved plus every receipt is valid. TDD regressions distinguish outside-Git unresolved evidence from a resolved empty Git receipt store. Final verification: linked tests 3/3 passed (104 focused assertions across suites), quality:static passed, full coverage passed 590 files / 8,169 tests at exact 100/100/100/100, and manual CLI acceptance proved exit 1 + resolved=false + complete=false outside Git versus ok=true + resolved=true + complete=true in an initialized Git workspace."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-31T10:27:30.723Z","harness:codex",An empty evidence set is trustworthy only after its clone-local source was positively resolved; directory-resolution absence must be modeled separately from zero invalid receipts and must fail loss-aware gates closed.
